[Controversy over finding magic portals]
In wizard mode, I have verified that:

Reading a scroll of gold detection while confused will give the message
"You feel entrapped." and reveal the location of all traps. 

Reading a cursed scroll of gold detection will show both traps and gold as
gold.

Quaffing a potion of object detection that is either cursed or while 
confused will do nothing in the way of revealing traps, much less
magic portals.

